  "description": "“I’d like it if you’d sleep with me. Would you sleep with me?”\n\nFrom the very beginning, I thought she was a strange woman.\n\n“Why me, of all people?”\n“…Because you’re handsome. Like they say, a pretty rice cake is tastier.”\n\nOne day, she suddenly appeared out of nowhere, cracking absurd jokes to make a fool of me.\nNot only did she hit me where I least expected it with her seemingly docile face,\nbut she also dared to comfort me, despite living a pitifully miserable life herself.\n\nI thought she was like a stone.\nAlways getting in the way, irritating me with every step I took,\nmaking me turn back over and over again, disrupting my life so relentlessly.\n\n“You said you didn’t want to earlier….”\n“I’ve changed my mind.”\n“What?”\n“I said, I’ve changed my mind.”\n\nNow, if I throw you away,\nI feel like my own feet would hurt.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65742563), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91-%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EB%B6%88%ED%96%89-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4362)     \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65742579)\n\n**Official Translations:**      \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/180771)     \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/180770)",
